# East: Steamwheedle Port, Lost Rigger Cove, the Wastewander camps ---------------------------------

goto "Ride east to Steamwheedle Port on the coast" at 66.8,23.5 r 30
accept 95383
turnin 95383
accept 95312
accept 8365
turnin 3520
accept 8366
accept 97530
accept 2873
tip Stoley and Security Chief Bilgewhizzle stand inside the building by the docks.
goto "Ride south along the coast to Lost Rigger Cove, the Southsea pirate camp" at 72.4,45.9 r 30
tip The cove lies behind the cliffs: a small tunnel on the coast at about 68.5,41.4 leads into it.
do 8365 bg
tip All four kinds of Southsea pirate drop hats, about two kills in five. You each need 20, so kill everything in the cove.
do 8366
tip Dock workers fill the piers; more pirates stand on the wooden platforms and inside the huts.
do 2873
tip The stolen cargo is on the second floor of the house on the west side of the cove. Four or five pirates wait at the foot of its stairs and come together: be ready for the whole group.
do 2875
tip Andre Firebeard stands by the campfire in the middle of the walled pirate town (around 73,47) with two pirates. Clear what is around first and pull him apart from them if you can.
do 8365
