tip Deliver to MacKinley is for a later guide in Booty Bay: keep it.
turnin 2875
do 2781 bg
tip Caliph Scorpidsting spawns at the Waterspring camp (around 59,39) and walks between the water towers (60-63,31-37) with two stealthed Wastewander Rogues. Don't fight him in the camp, where the shadow mages join in: catch him out by a tower. He respawns in under ten minutes.
do 1691 at 58.7,37.8
tip The Wastewander Rogues and Assassins are stealthed: they show only when close, so look for extra ones around every group. Each shadow mage brings a voidwalker.
