# Dustwallow Marsh --------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Brackenwall Village" npc 7824
map Dustwallow Marsh
accept 1172
tip Draz'Zilb stands in the small cave at the south end of the village.
do 1187
tip The Gizmorium Shipping Crate lies in the wreck of a crashed zeppelin in the middle of the marsh (around 54,56). The way in over the hills is at about 55,51; the wreck itself is quiet.
do 1172
tip The eggs sit in nests in broken tree stumps across the Wyrmbog in the far south (around 53,72, 56,75, 52,83 and 56,81), several to a nest, with dragonkin guarding them: clear the guards, then click the eggs to destroy them.
turnin 1172
hearth npc 7733

