# South: the Gaping Chasm and OOX-17/TN ------------------------------------------------------------

goto "Ride south to the Gaping Chasm and go into the cave" at 55.8,68.9 r 20
do 10
tip Scrimshank's gear lies deep in the hive: go down the spiral ramp, through a big round room and the one tunnel beyond it into a big square room shaped like a butterfly. The gear, a little machine, stands in that room's north-west corner with one guard. The Hazzali swarmers call up adds fast: keep to the walls.
accept 351 at 60.2,64.7 "Use the OOX-17/TN Distress Beacon, if one dropped"
tip No beacon yet? Kill what is around you for a while, or skip the robot. Both of you must hand in Find OOX-17/TN! before either accepts the escort.
turnin 351
accept 648
do 648 at 66.8,24.0 "Escort OOX-17/TN to Steamwheedle Port"
tip The robot walks on its own and is weak (level 42): stay close, or you fail the escort. Two ambushes come: three scorpids (47) at the first ridge, and three Wastewander near the end; kill the Scofflaw among them first, it executes anyone under 20% health.

